#: build/index.523987b487aefc323953.js:51
msgid "Availability"
msgstr ""

#: build/index.523987b487aefc323953.js:51
msgid "Checks the site regularly, alerts you when it goes down and when it is back, and keeps the history of uptime and response time. It also tracks when the SSL certificate and the domain expire."
msgstr ""

#: build/index.523987b487aefc323953.js:51
msgid "Known vulnerabilities"
msgstr ""

#: build/index.523987b487aefc323953.js:51
msgid "Compares the plugins, themes and WordPress version of the site with a vulnerability database and warns you when something installed is affected. Google Safe Browsing tells you if the site gets flagged as dangerous."
