#: build/index.523987b487aefc323953.js:51
msgid "Outdated PHP"
msgstr ""

#: build/index.523987b487aefc323953.js:51
msgid "Shows which PHP version the site runs on and warns you when it no longer gets security updates or has a critical vulnerability."
msgstr ""

#: build/index.523987b487aefc323953.js:51
msgid "Speed and SEO"
msgstr ""

#: build/index.523987b487aefc323953.js:51
msgid "Measures the speed with Google PageSpeed regularly and keeps the history. A public SEO test and audit check the basics of search engine optimisation."
msgstr ""

#: build/index.523987b487aefc323953.js:51
msgid "Looks and accessibility"
msgstr ""

#: build/index.523987b487aefc323953.js:51
msgid "Takes screenshots of key pages every day and compares them, so a broken layout does not go unnoticed. Once a month it scans the site for accessibility problems."
msgstr ""

#: build/index.523987b487aefc323953.js:51
msgid "Alerts and reports"
msgstr ""

#: build/index.523987b487aefc323953.js:51
msgid "Alerts arrive by e-mail, Discord, Slack or as a notification on your phone or computer, with a daily digest if you prefer fewer messages. Regular e-mail reports sum up how the site is doing."
msgstr ""

#: build/index.523987b487aefc323953.js:51
msgid "Shared protection"
msgstr ""

#: build/index.523987b487aefc323953.js:51
msgid "Ban an IP address, a range or a whole country once and it is blocked on every connected site. The central application also gives the site its CAPTCHA keys, so you set nothing up by hand."
msgstr ""

#: build/index.523987b487aefc323953.js:51
msgid "Support tickets"
msgstr ""

#: build/index.523987b487aefc323953.js:51
msgid "Service requests from the site land in one ticket queue, with replies and response deadlines."
msgstr ""

#: build/index.523987b487aefc323953.js:51
msgid "Content, social networks and reviews"
msgstr ""

#: build/index.523987b487aefc323953.js:51
msgid "Edit posts, pages and media of the site from one place, plan posts for Facebook, Instagram and LinkedIn and get help from the AI assistant. Google reviews of the business are collected in one list."
