#: build/index.523987b487aefc323953.js:51
msgid "What can the central application do on my site?"
msgstr ""

#: build/index.523987b487aefc323953.js:51
msgid "It reads the state of the site and works with posts, pages and media through requests signed with the secret key. Signing in as an administrator and installing packages from the central application are switched off."
